{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026JFUsYKhLzy1792802144.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>據報SpaceX正籌組的400億美元表外債務，受到近期市場疲弱影響，或出現延誤。</p><p></p><p>《彭博》報道，SpaceX正透過一家特殊項目公司，籌集資金買入輝達晶片，以推動AI人工智能業務。融資由投資銀行高盛牽頭，正與阿波羅全球管理牽頭的投資者，商議債務結構及條款。</p><p></p><p>報道指出，近期AI股份被拋售，引發信貸投資者，更加關注AI投資涉及的龐大債務，令SpaceX今次的融資，或面臨更高債息。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T01:24:24.831274+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":188,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T00:34:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T06:18:10.025381+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T01:18:27.106593+00:00","content_hash":"f85f816d3fca5df30c8b93b2204ac18abc71ca2f7390b5dcab02c9d77c801852","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-24T01:24:24.831274+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}